title: Affection
---
Midna: It's nice seeing you again, {$playerName}.
Midna: How are you finding the village?

-> I love it here.
    <<change_affection GameManager "characterone" 5>>
    {$playerName}: I love it here.
    <<jump Happy>>
-> I don't like it.
    <<change_affection GameManager "characterone" -5>>
    {$playerName}: I don't like it.
    <<jump Sad>>

